        "windows": "stop: hand to the user \u2014 no admin: download PortableGit 2.56.1 from https://github.com/git-for-windows/git/releases/download/v2.56.1.windows.1/PortableGit-2.56.1-64-bit.7z.exe and check it: certutil -hashfile PortableGit-2.56.1-64-bit.7z.exe SHA256 must print 9dd04a608ceb5f6ab32a73709e0ecb159d211da71b697c45ff81f6dd0c6b49c7 (SHA-256 from the official v2.56.1.windows.1 release notes); then run: PortableGit-2.56.1-64-bit.7z.exe -o\"{root}/PortableGit\" -y ; then re-run ensure_tools.py"
      }
